# Free GitHub Pages stack. Do not put Resend or Vercel keys here.
#
# Resend API keys must only live in .env.local (never commit .env or .env.local).
# A Resend key was previously committed in git history; rotate any leaked key in
# the Resend dashboard. Do not rewrite git history or force-push to scrub it.
#
# Cursor API keys (CURSOR_API_KEY) also belong only in .env.local — never VITE_*.

INQUIRY_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=adubsqz@gmail.com

# FormSubmit: after you click Activate Form, use the hash from that email — not the inbox.
# VITE_FORMSUBMIT_ID=9e5f95e3027a5d9d5fd6e84de3e2ebf4
# VITE_FORMSUBMIT_EMAIL=adubsqz@gmail.com

# Optional: Web3Forms public access key (safe for the browser; not a Resend secret)
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Optional: Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token (public-by-design; set as GitHub Actions secret VITE_CF_BEACON_TOKEN)
# VITE_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=

# Local gallery tooling
# GALLERY_PHOTO_PROMPT=/Users/alexanderames/photography/photo-prompt/.venv/bin/photo-prompt
# GALLERY_PHOTO_PROMPT_MODEL=llama3.1:8b

# Optional local Cursor SDK smoke (gitignored tools/cursor-sdk-smoke.mjs)
# CURSOR_API_KEY=
